{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21270","headline":"酬乐天赴江州路上见寄三首 二 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天赴江州路上见寄三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"襄阳大堤绕，我向堤前住。\n烛随花艳来，骑送朝云去。\n万竿高庙竹，三月徐亭树。\n我昔忆君时，君今怀我处。\n有身有离别，无地无岐路。\n风尘同古今，人世劳新故。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21270.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21270","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}